    "audioCorrection": "Monotonic piecewise clock warp using measured anchors, polyphase bandlimited resampling. Nearby diagnostic emissions are clustered to avoid exaggerated local rate changes. Game channels 0/1 only; diagnostic channel 2 excluded. The raw clock is nonlinear; omitted-neighbor diagnostics are not corrected-movie lag. Finished-file image/audio/voice checks are separate.",
